    "Arrow keys navigate items. Return opens details. X toggles selection. Shift–Up/Down extends selection; Command–A selects visible items. Escape clears selection. In selection mode, Space toggles selection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "方向键浏览条目，Return 打开详情，X 切换选中状态。Shift＋上下方向键扩展或缩小选择范围，⌘A 选择可见条目，Escape 清除选择。选择模式下，空格键切换选中状态。"
